"filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "格式"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "编码器"}], "flags": {}, "id": 92, "type": "SaveVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveVideo"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [295], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["### 15-second facial expression prompt (second by second)\nBase setting: Japanese girl with short black hair, **skin tone remains completely unchanged for the entire duration, no reddening, blushing or color shift on skin**, outdoor natural sunlight, rainbow star lens flare on cheeks, extreme close-up facial shot, realistic film texture, only facial muscle & eye expression change, skin always keeps original fair tone\n1s: Eyes bent into lovely crescents, full wide smile showing neat white upper teeth, lively bright pupils, relaxed facial muscles, genuine joyful smile\n2s: Maintains soft sweet smile, outer corners of eyes naturally lifted, facial muscles loose and relaxed, lively light inside pupils\n3s: Smile gradually softens, lips close halfway, only a faint shallow smile left at the corners of the mouth, eyes still gentle and bright\n4s: Mouth corners slowly flatten, faint smile fully disappears, upper eyelids sink down a little, gaze turns calm\n5s: Lips naturally closed into a straight line, no smile, facial muscles relaxed in neutral state, plain tranquil expression\n6s: Inner ends of eyebrows slowly draw slightly inward, the brightness inside the eyes fades away, gaze becomes duller, no skin color change\n7s: Eyebrows tighten faintly, upper eyelids droop more obviously, eyelashes quiver subtly, only subtle movement of eye muscles, skin color stays the same\n8s: Eyebrows keep furrowing, eyes lose sparkling light, sight drifts slightly out of focus, facial muscles begin to tense faintly\n9s: Lower lip gently presses inward and gets slightly tucked, brows crease deeper, eyes stare blankly forward, holding back emotion\n10s: Clear teardrops gather inside eye sockets without spilling out, eyelashes become moist, brows stay furrowed tightly, skin retains original color entirely\n11s: Eyelashes wet with tiny tear beads, gaze hollow and empty, facial jaw tightens slightly to restrain crying movements\n12s: One teardrop slowly glides down the cheek, corners of the mouth sink downwards naturally, brows knit tightly, helpless sad facial state\n13s: Eyes half-lidded, more tears well up in eyes, jaw clenched subtly to hold back sobs, all sadness expressed only through eyes and mouth shape\n14s: Eyebrows furrow tightly into a frown, tears keep sliding down cheeks, pupils dim completely, facial muscles slacken with sorrow\n15s: Eyes droop down to stare at the ground, brows still knitted, silent quiet weeping, all emotional changes rely on facial muscle expressions only, skin color never alters"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1195.38037109375, 5592.5732421875], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [294], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [307.13525390625, 395.425537109375], "pos": [-1518.3260498046875, 5586.03662109375], "widgets_values": ["80818518da0e0e8e61b02612bc725e27275eaa7ebc312690ba8929b45d65bae2.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": 